A||||8||86SE||Smooth as GLASS!||||10||
Z||000000||86SE||07-15-2000||01:35 AM||||<BR>Just shot the bumpers, hood, and fenders! (with paint)<P>They look SUPER sweet!!  Ferrari Gailo Modena Yellow is the color, code 102.  2 coats of that and 2 coats clear coat, and it is as smooth as glass!  NO imperfections, scratches, chips, nothing - very impressed1  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>The rest of the car will be shot tomorrow and Sunday.  Then I put it all back together on Monday.  All together it will be a $2000 paint job, excellent quality.  Its a color change, everything yellow except the mirrors, moldings, and engine vents.<P>I'll get some pictures posted next weekend of the finished product.<P>------------------<BR>'86 Special Edition,<BR>High-Output V-6 Fiero||||reg||10
